(6150257, 906884, 38930, '<td valign="top">oh bummer, it looks like you had a tough time uploading this, but I shall not count that against you :)  Nice shot of the plane - maybe next time crouch down and take it from a lower angle to make it look bigger and to take a lot of the background fields out of the photo.</td>', 'oh bummer, it looks like you had a tough time uploading this, but I shall not count that against you :)  Nice shot of the plane - maybe next time crouch down and take it from a lower angle to make it look bigger and to take a lot of the background fields out of the photo.', '2010-09-02 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150258, 906158, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, is this real?  Poor girl :(  This is a shot that should go onto charity websites.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, is this real?  Poor girl :(  This is a shot that should go onto charity websites.  Nice work.', '2010-09-02 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150260, 906755, 38930, '<td valign="top">It''s a little hard to make out since it''s black and white, so perhaps color would have worked better?  Regardless, nice shot - I like your composition.</td>', 'It''s a little hard to make out since it''s black and white, so perhaps color would have worked better?  Regardless, nice shot - I like your composition.', '2010-09-02 21:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150261, 905784, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s so much detail in the fire - I really like it!</td>', 'Wow, there''s so much detail in the fire - I really like it!', '2010-09-02 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150263, 906840, 38930, '<td valign="top">perfect shot and perfect title!</td>', 'perfect shot and perfect title!', '2010-09-02 21:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150266, 906881, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!</td>', 'Nice composition!', '2010-09-02 21:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150267, 906343, 38930, '<td valign="top">That''s nasty.  I''m sure some people will vote you down for his lack of life (I won''t) but maybe next time show how he died too.  Knife, car, dog, etc.  It might add to the photo...</td>', 'That''s nasty.  I''m sure some people will vote you down for his lack of life (I won''t) but maybe next time show how he died too.  Knife, car, dog, etc.  It might add to the photo...', '2010-09-02 21:59:23.000000', NULL, 1);
