(6151058, 906028, 68020, '<td valign="top">That''s funny!</td>', 'That''s funny!', '2010-09-03 15:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151180, 906029, 34938, '<td valign="top">would be great to see the polar bear, but I guess you know that already...light is nice 7</td>', 'would be great to see the polar bear, but I guess you know that already...light is nice 7', '2010-09-03 16:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151275, 906565, 37104, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but I''m unsure why this is in black and white. The colors would have been nice, I think.</td>', 'Good capture, but I''m unsure why this is in black and white. The colors would have been nice, I think.', '2010-09-03 18:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151279, 906607, 37104, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting moment. While not a dramatic shot, it still tells a good story. Maybe better than any other entries.</td>', 'It''s an interesting moment. While not a dramatic shot, it still tells a good story. Maybe better than any other entries.', '2010-09-03 18:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151281, 906029, 37104, '<td valign="top">Really well shot and edited. There are some nagging distractions here, like the finger in the foreground and the paw and sliver of black at the top. But nice job focusing on the people.</td>', 'Really well shot and edited. There are some nagging distractions here, like the finger in the foreground and the paw and sliver of black at the top. But nice job focusing on the people.', '2010-09-03 18:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151282, 906611, 37104, '<td valign="top">This comes off as more of a portrait than something that would run in a paper, but it''s still interesting and tells a story.</td>', 'This comes off as more of a portrait than something that would run in a paper, but it''s still interesting and tells a story.', '2010-09-03 18:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151283, 906452, 37104, '<td valign="top">A little too wide. Would be nice to hone in on the people or officer. It''s hard here to ascertain exactly what the story is. Also no need to be in B&amp;W. Makes it more dramatic, but also takes out what could have been some nice details.</td>', 'A little too wide. Would be nice to hone in on the people or officer. It''s hard here to ascertain exactly what the story is. Also no need to be in B&W. Makes it more dramatic, but also takes out what could have been some nice details.', '2010-09-03 18:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151284, 906749, 37104, '<td valign="top">Good angle, good composition. Classic small town photojournalism.</td>', 'Good angle, good composition. Classic small town photojournalism.', '2010-09-03 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151286, 905809, 37104, '<td valign="top">Good moment, but would have been nice to get a different angle, maybe more of the fire. There''s just a lot of space where we just see grass, non-burning trees and the truck. All of which aren''t necessary. Also looks like a little bright. Watch the exposure.</td>', 'Good moment, but would have been nice to get a different angle, maybe more of the fire. There''s just a lot of space where we just see grass, non-burning trees and the truck. All of which aren''t necessary. Also looks like a little bright. Watch the exposure.', '2010-09-03 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151287, 905784, 37104, '<td valign="top">You can just title it what it really is.. It''s interesting. I like the silhouettes. I don''t like that street light.</td>', 'You can just title it what it really is.. It''s interesting. I like the silhouettes. I don''t like that street light.', '2010-09-03 18:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151290, 906347, 37104, '<td valign="top">If it''s his debut, we need to see him in action. Or at very least his face. A cutline would be able to say his name.</td>', 'If it''s his debut, we need to see him in action. Or at very least his face. A cutline would be able to say his name.', '2010-09-03 18:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151291, 906584, 37104, '<td valign="top">But what''s the news? What''s the story?</td>', 'But what''s the news? What''s the story?', '2010-09-03 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151292, 906677, 37104, '<td valign="top">You need a tighter crop, but good capture.</td>', 'You need a tighter crop, but good capture.', '2010-09-03 18:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151295, 906158, 37104, '<td valign="top">This looks staged...? If not, I''m terribly sorry. If it is, it''s not photojournalsim.</td>', 'This looks staged...? If not, I''m terribly sorry. If it is, it''s not photojournalsim.', '2010-09-03 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151299, 906189, 37104, '<td valign="top">Would be nicer to have a good moment of people shouting or cheering. While this is nice, the image of the flag isn''t nearly as interesting as the image of real emotion on somebody''s face.</td>', 'Would be nicer to have a good moment of people shouting or cheering. While this is nice, the image of the flag isn''t nearly as interesting as the image of real emotion on somebody''s face.', '2010-09-03 18:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151300, 906699, 37104, '<td valign="top">Would be more interesting if you had him actually doing something. Speaking with hands is always a sure thing. Needs a much tighter crop as well.</td>', 'Would be more interesting if you had him actually doing something. Speaking with hands is always a sure thing. Needs a much tighter crop as well.', '2010-09-03 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151301, 906722, 37104, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, but a wedding isn''t news.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, but a wedding isn''t news.', '2010-09-03 18:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151302, 906884, 37104, '<td valign="top">Makes for a pretty good feature shot.</td>', 'Makes for a pretty good feature shot.', '2010-09-03 18:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151303, 906185, 37104, '<td valign="top">A little confusing. Too many people in the way. For sports, you really have to use a very high shutter speed.</td>', 'A little confusing. Too many people in the way. For sports, you really have to use a very high shutter speed.', '2010-09-03 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151304, 906678, 37104, '<td valign="top">The editing looks strange.</td>', 'The editing looks strange.', '2010-09-03 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151305, 906449, 37104, '<td valign="top">Well done, but would have been nicer if you focused on a tight shot of one of the kids.</td>', 'Well done, but would have been nicer if you focused on a tight shot of one of the kids.', '2010-09-03 18:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151306, 906784, 37104, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too far away. Get in there! We want to see the action. Good exposure though.</td>', 'It''s a little too far away. Get in there! We want to see the action. Good exposure though.', '2010-09-03 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151310, 906689, 37104, '<td valign="top">Where''s the ball? Without it, we just have a bunch of guys jumping and standing around.</td>', 'Where''s the ball? Without it, we just have a bunch of guys jumping and standing around.', '2010-09-03 18:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151664, 906722, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2010-09-04 06:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151665, 906607, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great title and photo! The guy and the horse seem tired though :).</td>', 'Great title and photo! The guy and the horse seem tired though :).', '2010-09-04 06:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151920, 906189, 96751, '<td valign="top">Definitely has the right stuff, nice balance with the flag and the Lincoln memorial.  Just wish your settings had made it a little contrastier....</td>', 'Definitely has the right stuff, nice balance with the flag and the Lincoln memorial.  Just wish your settings had made it a little contrastier....', '2010-09-04 14:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151921, 906677, 96751, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn good for minimal!</td>', 'Pretty darn good for minimal!', '2010-09-04 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151924, 906345, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great marine abstract, and strong colors, but not feeling the journalism here...</td>', 'Great marine abstract, and strong colors, but not feeling the journalism here...', '2010-09-04 14:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151937, 906029, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the fish overhead!!!</td>', 'Love the fish overhead!!!', '2010-09-04 15:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151978, 906029, 63503, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect with a bit more of the polar bear showing. Still a great picture though!</td>', 'This would have been perfect with a bit more of the polar bear showing. Still a great picture though!', '2010-09-04 16:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151979, 906343, 63503, '<td valign="top">Disgusting spectacle but good documentary picture</td>', 'Disgusting spectacle but good documentary picture', '2010-09-04 16:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6151980, 906128, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nat Geo picture! beautiful.</td>', 'Nat Geo picture! beautiful.', '2010-09-04 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152056, 906678, 84410, '<td valign="top">careful on the clarity. its a good effect but less is more... nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'careful on the clarity. its a good effect but less is more... nice photo otherwise.', '2010-09-04 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152066, 906029, 32346, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture, but like you cant see no polar bear is more about the tourists watching. Their face expressions are awesome! I will crop the black line at the left. Nice colors!</td>', 'I really like the picture, but like you cant see no polar bear is more about the tourists watching. Their face expressions are awesome! I will crop the black line at the left. Nice colors!', '2010-09-04 19:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152208, 906128, 23394, '<td valign="top">more interesting than most, but would have had more impact had you shot her from the front.</td>', 'more interesting than most, but would have had more impact had you shot her from the front.', '2010-09-04 23:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152212, 906347, 23394, '<td valign="top">nope.  nothing but a name on a jersey.  no action, no face, no story.</td>', 'nope.  nothing but a name on a jersey.  no action, no face, no story.', '2010-09-04 23:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152214, 906841, 23394, '<td valign="top">and you''d be thrown out before the ball hit the ground ;-)  number one rule of shooting golf:  you can''t push the shutter until the club hits the ball (the little click can throw someone off).<br/> <br/>from a pj perspective, nothing interesting here.  if you had shot from a different angle, after the ball strike, you would have had some action and possibly some emotion.</td>', 'and you''d be thrown out before the ball hit the ground ;-)  number one rule of shooting golf:  you can''t push the shutter until the club hits the ball (the little click can throw someone off). from a pj perspective, nothing interesting here.  if you had shot from a different angle, after the ball strike, you would have had some action and possibly some emotion.', '2010-09-04 23:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152215, 906678, 23394, '<td valign="top">this actually has front page potential.  nice composition.  really like the shadow of the machinery.</td>', 'this actually has front page potential.  nice composition.  really like the shadow of the machinery.', '2010-09-04 23:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152217, 906759, 23394, '<td valign="top">this actually has front page potential.  nothing spectacular, but it does get the point across.</td>', 'this actually has front page potential.  nothing spectacular, but it does get the point across.', '2010-09-05 00:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152219, 905959, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice action shot!</td>', 'nice action shot!', '2010-09-05 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152220, 906689, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work!</td>', 'excellent work!', '2010-09-05 00:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152221, 906699, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work.  the only thing i prefer when someone''s at a podium is to get a shot of them gesturing, rather than gripping (it makes for a little more dynamic photo).</td>', 'nice work.  the only thing i prefer when someone''s at a podium is to get a shot of them gesturing, rather than gripping (it makes for a little more dynamic photo).', '2010-09-05 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152222, 906844, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice beaver shot, but hardly front page material.</td>', 'nice beaver shot, but hardly front page material.', '2010-09-05 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152223, 906845, 23394, '<td valign="top">yeah, this could wind up on a front page.</td>', 'yeah, this could wind up on a front page.', '2010-09-05 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152224, 905528, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but not really front page quality.  if you had gotten in closer and shot from any other perspective than standing eye-level, you could have come away with a more dynamic, story telling image.</td>', 'nice idea, but not really front page quality.  if you had gotten in closer and shot from any other perspective than standing eye-level, you could have come away with a more dynamic, story telling image.', '2010-09-05 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152226, 906784, 23394, '<td valign="top">the story''s in your caption, not in your image...you needed to go across to the middle and shown the cars backed up down the road.  as long as you''re not interfering with emergency personnel, you can go anywhere you want...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=362081" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/523/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_362081.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/523/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_362081.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/523/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_362081.jpg"/></a></td>', 'the story''s in your caption, not in your image...you needed to go across to the middle and shown the cars backed up down the road.  as long as you''re not interfering with emergency personnel, you can go anywhere you want...', '2010-09-05 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152228, 906029, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent feature photo, but not enough polar bar to justify the caption.  great job on the exposure and composition, considering the editing rule set.<br/> <br/>----------<br/>my pick for the blue, just based on image quality.</td>', 'excellent feature photo, but not enough polar bar to justify the caption.  great job on the exposure and composition, considering the editing rule set. ----------my pick for the blue, just based on image quality.', '2010-09-05 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152693, 905635, 103069, '<td valign="top">Lacks the topic of Photojournalism</td>', 'Lacks the topic of Photojournalism', '2010-09-05 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152695, 906565, 103069, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the rider and horse</td>', 'Good shot of the rider and horse', '2010-09-05 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152698, 906611, 103069, '<td valign="top">The photo does not say the same thing as the title.  great photo of the gentlemen, but lacks story</td>', 'The photo does not say the same thing as the title.  great photo of the gentlemen, but lacks story', '2010-09-05 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152699, 906689, 103069, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and fits the topic</td>', 'Great shot, and fits the topic', '2010-09-05 19:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152701, 906677, 103069, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but would have been better if the extra player on the border was edited out of the shot.  He is caught in the edge of NO MAN''s Land</td>', 'Good shot, but would have been better if the extra player on the border was edited out of the shot.  He is caught in the edge of NO MAN''s Land', '2010-09-05 19:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152702, 906449, 103069, '<td valign="top">great shot......not very messy@!</td>', 'great shot......not very messy@!', '2010-09-05 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152704, 906784, 103069, '<td valign="top">To much highway, not enough subject.  Not a photo that would be published in a newspaper.</td>', 'To much highway, not enough subject.  Not a photo that would be published in a newspaper.', '2010-09-05 19:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6152709, 906567, 103069, '<td valign="top">very creative, not very photo journalistic</td>', 'very creative, not very photo journalistic', '2010-09-05 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
