(6156948, 906844, 120675, '<td valign="top">I Australian, so don''t know much about beavers at all except they were hunted heavily in times gone by. I take it they''re not exactly common and a little shy. Very appropriate for a national parks type newsletter / magazine. I wonder if a slightly wider shot would have helped to grab a little more context?</td>', 'I Australian, so don''t know much about beavers at all except they were hunted heavily in times gone by. I take it they''re not exactly common and a little shy. Very appropriate for a national parks type newsletter / magazine. I wonder if a slightly wider shot would have helped to grab a little more context?', '2010-09-08 20:37:03.000000', NULL, 0),
